---

---
<section class="bg-white py-20 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center">
    <h2 class="rs-wealth-title font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-8 text-center">
      Building generational wealth
    </h2>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-[#1a1a1a]">
      <p class="rs-wealth-body text-gray-700">
        Building generational wealth isn't about making one big step. Rather, it's about taking
        consistent, informed steps in the right direction. We break down complex financial concepts
        into clear, actionable lessons that meet you exactly where you are today.
      </p>

      <p class="rs-wealth-bold font-bold leading-tight">
        Whether you're mastering investment strategies, optimising your taxes, or building multiple
        income streams, our step-by-step approach ensures you're never overwhelmed or lost.
      </p>

      <div class="flex gap-6 border-l-2 border-black pl-6 py-2">
        <blockquote class="rs-wealth-quote italic text-gray-800">
          Building generational wealth isn't about making one big step. Rather, it's about taking
          consistent, informed steps in the right direction.
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <p class="rs-wealth-body text-gray-700">
        Each skill you develop builds on the last, creating a solid foundation that transforms your
        income into generational wealth.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '@/styles/fn.scss' as fn;

  .rs-wealth-title {
    font-size: fn.useResponsiveSize(320, 1024, 32, 48);
    font-family: var(--font-family);
  }

  .rs-wealth-body {
    font-size: fn.useResponsiveSize(320, 1024, 16, 18);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .rs-wealth-bold {
    font-size: fn.useResponsiveSize(320, 1024, 18, 24);
  }
  .rs-wealth-quote {
    font-size: fn.useResponsiveSize(320, 1024, 18, 22);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>
